## 1. Architecture Overview

| Aspect | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Framework** | React 18 + TypeScript |
| **Build tool** | Vite |
| **Styling** | Tailwind CSS v3 + custom CSS in `index.css` |
| **Routing** | React Router v6 (`react-router-dom`) |
| **Auth** | None — all routes are public |
| **Backend** | None — pure frontend static pages |
| **Animation library** | None — all animations are CSS-only (no framer-motion) |
| **State management** | None for marketing pages (one `useState` for mobile menu, one for Slack message cycling) |
| **Shared layout** | `MarketingLayout` component wraps every page (sticky navbar + footer) |
| **Route prefix** | All marketing routes live under `/site/*` |
| **Font** | `Inter` (loaded via system stack: `'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif`) |

