### 7.1 MarketingLayout

**File**: `src/components/Marketing/MarketingLayout.tsx`

**Description**: Wraps every marketing page. Contains a sticky navbar with logo, 4 nav links, two CTA buttons, mobile hamburger menu, and a 3-column footer.

