| Breakpoint | Behavior |
|---|---|
| Default (mobile) | Single column layouts, `text-5xl` hero, hamburger menu |
| `md:` (768px+) | 2-column grids, desktop nav hidden toggle |
| `lg:` (1024px+) | 4-column grids, `text-7xl` hero, larger padding (`lg:px-8`, `lg:py-28`) |

Key responsive patterns:
- Hero text: `text-5xl lg:text-7xl`
- Feature grids: `md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4`
- Section padding: `py-20 lg:py-28`
- Container: `max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8`
- Mobile menu: toggled via `useState`, shown only on `md:hidden`
- Buttons stack vertically on mobile: `flex-col sm:flex-row`

