## 15. Shared UI Component: Button

The marketing site uses shadcn's `Button` component. Key variants used:
- Default (primary fill)
- `variant="outline"`
- `variant="ghost"`
- `size="sm"` (navbar)
- `size="lg"` (hero CTAs, `h-12 px-8`)
- `asChild` prop to render as `<Link>` or `<a>`

The `cn()` utility from `@/lib/utils` combines `clsx` + `tailwind-merge`:

```ts
import { clsx, type ClassValue } from "clsx";
import { twMerge } from "tailwind-merge";

export function cn(...inputs: ClassValue[]) {
  return twMerge(clsx(inputs));
}
```
